00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:44.550
Mat: HELLO INTERNET, Welcome to Film Theory, where today can we just stop to appreciate

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:50.840
What a great year 2018 was? Oh, no not for me. For SPIDERMAN! His PS4 game

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:58.280
crushed! And was nearly Game Of The Year! Venom was way more enjoyable than most people expected and earned nearly a BILLION dollars,

